OL,3,GNEWSACar crash teenager had 'the world
OL,4,Aat his feet'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a teenager who died from
OL,7,Finjuries sustained in a car crash last
OL,8,Fweekend have paid tribute to a young
OL,9,Fman who they say "never ran out of love
OL,10,Fto give".
OL,12,FRahulan Chelliah was one of five
OL,13,F18-year-olds in a Fiat Punto which hit
OL,14,Fa tree in Church Lane, Headley near
OL,15,FLeatherhead at about 03:30 BST on
OL,16,FSunday.
OL,18,FHe has been described by his family as
OL,19,Fa "caring and protective brother" who
OL,20,Fvalued "honesty, humility and
OL,21,Fpatience".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
