OL,3,GNEWSACar crash teenager had 'the world
OL,4,Aat his feet'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 18-year-old man who was driving the
OL,7,Fcar was arrested on suspicion of
OL,8,Fdriving while unfit through drink or
OL,9,Fdrugs, driving while over the limit and
OL,10,Fcausing serious injury by dangerous
OL,11,Fdriving.
